          "settings": {
            "title_id": "delivery",
            "title": "I have another question!",
            "answer": "You can view all our FAQs by <a href=\"https://cupcakecentral.com.au/pages/faqs\">clicking here</a>, or you can contact our customer service team by calling 9077 4542 or emailing service@cupcakecentral.com.au. Please note than our customer service hours are between 9am and 4pm Monday to Friday, and 9am to 1pm on Saturdays. If you'd like to contact us outside of these hours, please send us an email and we'll get back to you as soon as we can!"
